data gitlab_fy2024_net_vs_operating_divergence_note: String = "FY2024 is the outlier year: net loss 424.174 million USD against an operating loss of 187.440 million USD. The gap is non-operating (income-tax and JiHu joint-venture related charges below the operating line), not a change in the cost of running the platform -- the trend witness therefore tracks OPERATING loss, and the net-income rows stay faithful to the filed totals."

